          },
          {
            "id": 2840288,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "This evening, we're delighted to welcome Dan Beagle, who's just written a book on looking for and finding food in the wild. He's going to tell us everything we need to know about picking wild mushrooms.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2840289,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This evening, we're delighted to welcome Dan Beagle, who's just written a book on looking for and finding food in the wild.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 50.824997,
                  "from": 40.985,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840312,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "He's going to tell us everything we need to know about picking wild mushrooms.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 56.585,
                  "from": 51.305,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2840327,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Thank you very much. Well, I need to start by talking about safety. You really need to know what you're doing because some mushrooms are extremely poisonous. Having said that, once you know what to look for, it's really worth doing for the amazing variety of mushrooms available, which you can't get in the shops. But, of course, you have to be very careful, and that's why I always say you should never consume mushrooms picked by friends or neighbors.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2840328,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thank you very much.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 58.8,
                  "from": 57.52,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840333,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, I need to start by talking about safety.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 63.04,
                  "from": 59.280003,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840343,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You really need to know what you're doing because some mushrooms are extremely poisonous.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 69.28,
                  "from": 63.68,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840358,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Having said that, once you know what to look for, it's really worth doing for the amazing variety of mushrooms available, which you can't get in the shops.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 81.715,
                  "from": 70.595,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840387,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But, of course, you have to be very careful, and that's why I always say you should never consume mushrooms picked by friends or neighbors.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 92.14,
                  "from": 82.515,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2840413,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Always remember that some poisonous mushrooms look very similar to edible ones, and it's easy for people to get confused. The other thing to avoid is mushrooms growing beside busy roads for obvious reasons. But nothing beats the taste of freshly picked mushrooms. Don't forget that the ones in the shops are often several days old and past their best. There are certain ideas about wild mushrooms that it's important to be aware of.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2840414,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Always remember that some poisonous mushrooms look very similar to edible ones, and it's easy for people to get confused.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 102.755,
                  "from": 92.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840435,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The other thing to avoid is mushrooms growing beside busy roads for obvious reasons.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 110.59499,
                  "from": 103.955,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840450,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But nothing beats the taste of freshly picked mushrooms.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 114.755,
                  "from": 111.235,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840460,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Don't forget that the ones in the shops are often several days old and past their best.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 122.41,
                  "from": 115.450005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840478,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are certain ideas about wild mushrooms that it's important to be aware of.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.89,
                  "from": 123.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2840493,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Don't listen to people who tell you that it's only okay to eat mushrooms that are pale or dull. This is completely untrue. Some edible mushrooms are bright red, for example. Personally, I prefer mushrooms cooked, but it won't do you any harm to eat them uncooked in salads. It's not necessary to peel them.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2840494,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Don't listen to people who tell you that it's only okay to eat mushrooms that are pale or dull.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 138.195,
                  "from": 130.035,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840514,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is completely untrue.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.755,
                  "from": 138.675,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840519,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some edible mushrooms are bright red, for example.",
                "meta": {
