          {
            "id": 2840634,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Of course, mushroom picking is associated with the countryside. But if you haven't got a car, your local park can be a great place to start. There are usually a range of habitats where mushrooms grow, such as playing fields and wooded areas. But you need to be there first thing in the morning as there's likely to be a lot of competition, not just from people, but wildlife too. The deer often get the best mushrooms in my local park.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2840635,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Of course, mushroom picking is associated with the countryside.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 246.845,
                  "from": 242.36499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840645,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But if you haven't got a car, your local park can be a great place to start.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 252.605,
                  "from": 247.08499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840663,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are usually a range of habitats where mushrooms grow, such as playing fields and wooded areas.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 261.69,
                  "from": 253.84999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2840681,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But you need to be there first thing in the morning as there's likely to be a lot of competition, not just from people, but wildlife too.",
                "meta": {
